# PLAN.md

## Definition of Done — applies to every single slice

1. **No console errors or warnings** in the Metro terminal or the device log.
2. **Works on a real phone or simulator at the smallest supported screen size** — iPhone SE 3rd generation (375 × 667 pt logical resolution) or an equivalent-width Android. Every slice is tested on this device before it is marked done.
3. **Design tokens only** — no hardcoded hex colours, font names, font sizes, border-radii, or spacing values anywhere except `src/tokens.ts`. Run `grep -r "#FF5A1F\|#F4F1EA\|#151515" src/ --include="*.tsx" --include="*.ts"` before marking a slice done; the only file that may return results is `src/tokens.ts`.
4. **No secrets in the app bundle.** The Supabase anon key and the RevenueCat *public* SDK key are the only keys that may appear in app source. All other keys (OpenAI, service-role, webhook secrets) live exclusively in Edge Function environment variables set through the Supabase dashboard.
5. **RLS on every table** — no data table is queried before its Row Level Security (RLS) policies are in place. *RLS means: a database rule that says "this user may only read or write their own rows." Supabase enforces it automatically even if the app code has a bug.*
6. **TypeScript** — no `any` types and no `// @ts-ignore` comments.

---

