      { text: 'Cancel', style: 'cancel' },
      {
        text: 'Delete permanently',
        style: 'destructive',
        onPress: async () => {
          const { data: { session } } = await supabase.auth.getSession();
          const resp = await fetch(
            'https://YOUR_PROJECT_REF.supabase.co/functions/v1/delete-account',
            { method:'POST',
              headers:{ 'Authorization': `Bearer ${session?.access_token}` } }
          );
          if (resp.ok) {
            await supabase.auth.signOut();
            // navigation resets to SignInScreen via AuthContext
          } else {
            Alert.alert('Error', 'Could not delete account. '
              + 'Please contact support@formcoach.app');
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  );
```

**How to test:**
- Sign in as a test user. Profile → "Delete my account" → confirm dialog appears.
- Tap "Delete permanently". App returns to Sign In screen.
- Supabase → Authentication → Users: user is gone.
- Supabase → members, workouts, sets, videos tables: all rows for that user are gone (cascade deleted).
- Attempting to sign back in with those credentials fails.

**Done when:**
- Deleting account removes the user from Supabase Auth.
- All associated rows are cascade-deleted.
- Confirmation dialog shown before deletion.
- App navigates to Sign In on success.
- Error alert shown if deletion fails.

